  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "1910-root",
    "title": "Summer English Courses for AKU Students",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The courses allow students to invest their time in a more intensive manner of learning the English language. ",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "3c06790b0dc653c6",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "1910-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/1910-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Summer English Courses for AKU Students"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For the second time, ELE_net offered the 4-week intensive English courses to students in Karachi this summer.  These consisted of Grammar in Academic Writing,  Academic Presentation Skills and Conversational English. "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The courses allowed the students to invest their time in a more intensive manner of learning the English language. The students worked in small groups to build confidence in grammar, vocabulary, pronunciation, speaking, listening, reading and writing. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We highly encourage student participation as it not only adds interest to a particular course, but also provides a way to promote active learning. The plus point of all the courses was the blended learning that was provided to the students. These blended courses further enriched the students' experiences as they provided them with online learning in addition to face-to-face classes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Our goal is to build overall confidence in our students through classes which are fun, interesting and relevant to students' academic needs."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
